# New tab / close / restore / reload → Chrome (Cmd+T, Cmd+W, Shift+Cmd+T, Cmd+R)
unmap t
unmap T
unmap yt
unmap x
unmap X
unmap W
unmap r
unmap R

# History back/forward off; H/L = tabs (left/right)
unmap H
unmap L
map H previousTab
map L nextTab

# J/K = 2x scroll speed (unmaps default tab switching; use H/L instead)
unmap J
unmap K
map J scrollDown count=4
map K scrollUp count=4
